Boid Script—Part 3
Now that the Neighborhood component exists and is attached to the Boid GameObject,
it's time to finalize the Boid class. This code will add the following influences, all of which
are based on the other Boids within an individual Boid's neighborhood:
Q Collision avoidance: Boids will try not to run into other Boids that are too near.
Q Velocity matching: Boids try to match their velocity and direction to the
average velocity and direction of Boids they can see.
Q Flock centering: Boids try to move toward the average position of Boids they
can see.
